Apache-2.0 like the rest of this repository.

The upstream license texts are in LICENSES/, byte for byte as they are at the pinned tag. Each
entry below names the file, then the upstream repository, ref, path and git blob hash it was
taken from (tests/test_fragment.py checks the hashes).

